      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "For the normalized recurrence q_n=xq_{n-1}-Cq_{n-2}-q_{n-3}, C=3 is the included endpoint of the proved C≥3 real-zero/interlacing regime and the degenerate endpoint of the positive real moment-density construction; at the same specialization, the displayed initial Hankel determinants match the tabulated vertically symmetric ASM counts.",
